    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A superb 4 bedroom detached bungalow residence extending to c. 117 sq.m. sitting on circa 0.76 acre with landscaped gardens to the front. Excellently located on the R162 just 7kms from Navan Town.\r\n\r\nThis is a quaint property which oozes character. It was carefully extended over the year and was excellently maintained with good quality flooring, upgraded kitchen and well kept gardens.\r\n\r\nThe path to the front door with the front lawns bounded with daffodils set the tone of this beautiful home.\r\n\r\nThe property benefits from a spacious kitchen with lots of storage, centre island and the solid fuel stove makes the lounge a cosy sapce.\r\n\r\nThis is a lovely secluded site which offers lots of potential for extension or additions subject to the necessary planning permission. It benefits from mature trees and hedgerows around the boundaries.\r\n\r\nThe property enjoys gorgeous views overlooking the fine rolling lands to the front and to the rear the property is not overlooked with the Wolfe Tones GAA grounds just behind the back hedge.\r\n\r\nThe property has a gated access with tarmac driveway and good outbuildings to one side of the driveway.\r\n\r\nKilberry located just 7 kms outside Navan offers a very pleasant community with the benefits of Wilkinstown School only minutes from the property, pub, convenience store, Wilkinsown & Gibbstown community centres, Wolfe Tones GAA and numerous other sporting facilities close by.\r\n\r\nAlso a mention must be giving to our award winning Boyne Valley Greenway which enjoys pathway access from this property.\r\n\r\nAccommodation includes Entrance Hall, Lounge, Kitchen, Dining, 4 Bedrooms, Guest W.C. and Shower Room."
      }
    ],
